# Generated TypeScript build output for in-tree MCP servers
# (regenerable via `pnpm --filter @sentura/mcp-* build`). Glob covers
# gradsale-admin, gradsale-web, and any future Tier-2 servers.
sentura/mcp-servers/*/dist/

# Next.js autogen + per-machine secrets. `sentura-setup.sh` re-creates
# `.env.local` with each developer's own admin token — never commit it.
sentura/dashboard/.env.local
sentura/dashboard/next-env.d.ts

# Vendored OpenClaw's local-only runtime state and re-pull-clobbered
# lockfile. The whole `openclaw/` tree is wiped on upstream re-pull, so
# anything in here would just add churn.
openclaw/.local/
openclaw/pnpm-lock.yaml

# Person D's personal scratch space at the repo root (per
# `memory/person-d/CLAUDE.md`). The leading slash anchors to the repo
# root — bare `memory/` would also match `docs/memory/`, which is the
# team-shared session log and MUST stay tracked.
/memory/

